<title>SOUTH KOREA: NLCF buys 10,000T Thai tapioca, passes on 40,000T.</title>
<headline>NLCF buys 10,000T Thai tapioca, passes on 40,000T.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's National Livestock Cooperatives Federation (NLCF) on Tuesday bought 10,000 tonnes of Thai tapioca hard pellet at $87.50 a tonne from Soon Hwa Seng, an NLCF official said.</p>
<p>The official said it passed on tenders to buy 40,000 tonnes of tapioca hard pellet and 30,000 tonnes of wheat bran pellet or rice bran pellet due to high offer prices.</p>
<p>Details of the tender result:</p>
<p> COMMODITY  TONNE  ETA     ARRIVAL PORT   PRICE     SELLER</p>
<p> Tapioca   10,000  June 20  Inchon/Kunsan  $87.50  Soon Hwa Seng</p>
<p> Tapioca   10,000  July 10  Inchon/Kunsan  PASSED</p>
<p> Tapioca   10,000  July 30  Inchon/Kunsan  PASSED</p>
<p> Tapioca   10,000  Aug  20  Inchon/Kunsan  PASSED</p>
<p> Tapioca   10,000  Sept 10  Inchon/Kunsan  PASSED</p>
<p> Wheatbran 15,000  July 10  Kunsan/Ulsan   PASSED</p>
<p> Wheatbran 15,000  Sept 10  Kunsan/Ulsan   PASSED</p>
<p> Ricebran  15,000  July 10  Kunsan	   PASSED</p>
<p> Ricebran  15,000  Sept 10  Kunsan	   PASSED</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
